	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Browse and open your Netlify sites.

Type `net` for a window with every site, a live preview and its deploy details. Type to filter, ↑↓ to move. Enter opens the site, ⌘ Enter the Netlify project, ⌥ Enter copies the URL, ⌘[ and ⌘] go back and forward in the live preview, ⌘R refreshes. Right-click a row to open its deploys page or to sign out.

**Sign in:** the first time, click *Sign in to Netlify* in the window. Your browser opens on app.netlify.com; approve *Alfred Netlify* and the window opens again with your sites. The access token is stored in your macOS Keychain (service `alfred-netlify-workflow`).
</string>
